node_modules/
dist/
.vite/
*.local
.DS_Store
*.tsbuildinfo

.vercel
.env*

# The explainer video is deliberately NOT in git. It is 87MB, it never changes,
# and committing it would put that in every clone's history permanently.
#
# It still SHIPS: .vercelignore exists precisely so this file does not also
# exclude it from the deployment upload — without that file the Vercel CLI falls
# back to .gitignore and the video would silently never reach the site.
#
# A fresh clone therefore builds without the player rather than with a broken
# one; see the note in src/modules/colophon/Colophon.tsx and the README.
public/video/*.mp4

# The poster is 34KB and derived from public/og.png, so it stays in git. Only
# the one large file is the exception.
!public/video/poster.webp
